			(property "Description" "Pulse JD0-0004NL PulseJack RJ45 with integrated 1:1 magnetics (10/100BASE-TX), green and yellow LEDs, shielded, PoE-capable (spare-pair pins 7-10, terminated 75 R + 22 nF inside), 1500 VAC isolation. Pin functions from datasheet rev A sheet 2: 1/2 = TX pair (RJ45 1/2), 3/5 = RX pair (RJ45 3/6), 4 = PHY-side centre taps, shield through 1000 pF 2 kV."
