	(text "W6100 in SPI mode (MOD[3:0] = 0000) on SPI3. Support circuit per WIZnet W6100_Ref_Schematic_V110_use_mag:\n2 x 49.9R + 0.1 uF per pair at the MDI pins, jack centre taps to 3V3A, beads 3V3D->3V3A and 1V2D->1V2A,\nRSET_BG 12k + 300R (12.3k 1 %), 25 MHz crystal (CL 18 pF) with 27 pF and 1M. The jack's magnetics isolate the host."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
